    "final_message": "Implemented the Laravel 11 URL shortener with MySQL-backed link storage and persistent click counts.\n\n- Added `POST /links`, `GET /links`, `GET /links/{code}`, and `GET /r/{code}` with the requested response shapes and status codes.\n- Added URL and code validation, duplicate-code handling, and atomic click increments.\n- Configured routes without the `/api` prefix.\n- Added executable [start.sh](/workspace/start.sh), which runs migrations before serving on `0.0.0.0:8000` with `--no-reload`.\n- Added startup instructions to [README.md](/workspace/README.md).\n\nPHP syntax checks passed for the controller, routes, and Laravel bootstrap. I did not run the HTTP test suite."
